---
// The agent section's visual: the real chat-sidebar card language (fill
// message panels, `❯ you` / `✱ copilot` labels, a pending approval plan card,
// a `shell_session` tool card) with a homelab session: same illustrative
// world as the hero mock.
---

<section id="agent" class="section">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="visual">
      <div class="chips mono" data-reveal-stagger>
        <span class="chip">host homelab</span>
        <span class="chip">cwd /home/ops</span>
        <span class="chip">shell bash</span>
        <span class="chip">recent: sudo fail2ban-client status sshd</span>
      </div>
      <figure
        class="chatpane"
        aria-label="The agent sidebar: a hardening request, a pending plan card with two gated calls, and a shell_session tool card"
        data-reveal-step
      >
        <span class="card-title">chat</span>
        <div class="panel user">
          <div class="msg-label"><span class="you">❯ you</span><span class="afford">⧉ copy&nbsp;&nbsp;↺ revert</span></div>
          <div class="msg-body">harden ssh on homelab</div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel assistant">
          <div class="msg-label"><span class="who">✱ copilot</span><span class="afford">⧉ copy</span></div>
          <div class="msg-body">Two gated changes: the drop-in and a reload. Both run with sudo, in order.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel plan">
          <div class="plan-head"><span class="wait" data-pulse>▸</span> plan · 2 approvals</div>
          <div class="plan-line cursor">❯ ✓ [1/2] shell_background&nbsp; sudo tee /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/hardening.conf</div>
          <div class="plan-detail">    sudo tee /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/hardening.conf &lt;&lt;'EOF'</div>
          <div class="plan-detail">    PermitRootLogin prohibit-password</div>
          <div class="plan-detail">    PasswordAuthentication no</div>
          <div class="plan-detail">    EOF</div>
          <div class="plan-line">  ✓ [2/2] shell_background&nbsp; sudo systemctl reload sshd</div>
          <div class="plan-action">  [A approve all]</div>
          <div class="plan-action">  [N deny all]</div>
          <div class="plan-action">  [↵ confirm]</div>
          <div class="plan-action">  [esc cancel]</div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel session">
          <div class="tool-head">▸ shell_session&nbsp; systemctl status sshd</div>
          <div class="tool-status">  ● done</div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="copy" data-reveal-stagger>
      <h2 class="h2">The agent lives beside you.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        One tab = one shell = one chat session. The agent sees the cwd, shell, and recent output,
        including git status when there is one. It investigates in a hidden shell, and <code>shell_session</code>
        types into your visible pane on request, special keys included.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        It keeps notes between sessions: environment memory, a host map of this machine, and a
        journal of what it did. Plain markdown under <code>~/.config/sensus/</code>, alongside your
        own <code>AGENTS.md</code> instructions.
      </p>
      <ul class="facts mono">
        <li>every action asks first · allow rules skip the card</li>
        <li>pane typing is free · nothing runs until you confirm</li>
        <li>plan cards: approve all / deny all / confirm</li>
        <li>sudo steps: masked password prompt, cached for the session</li>
        <li><code>/yolo</code> flips to full-auto when you want it</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .visual {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.9rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .chip {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .chatpane {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 0.85rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px; /* one terminal cell, like the app's ╭ ╮ ╰ ╯ glyphs */
  }

  .card-title {
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.62em;
    left: 0.7em;
    padding: 0 0.45em;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  /* The app's fill cards are not rounded: a solid surface with a half-cell
     rectangular notch at each corner (the ▟ ▙ ▜ ▛ quadrant glyphs, see
     docs/DESIGN.md "Chat sidebar"). Mirror the step, not an arc. */
  .panel {
    --notch-x: 4px;
    --notch-y: 7px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    clip-path: polygon(
      var(--notch-x) 0,
      calc(100% - var(--notch-x)) 0,
      calc(100% - var(--notch-x)) var(--notch-y),
      100% var(--notch-y),
      100% calc(100% - var(--notch-y)),
      calc(100% - var(--notch-x)) calc(100% - var(--notch-y)),
      calc(100% - var(--notch-x)) 100%,
      var(--notch-x) 100%,
      var(--notch-x) calc(100% - var(--notch-y)),
      0 calc(100% - var(--notch-y)),
      0 var(--notch-y),
      var(--notch-x) var(--notch-y)
    );
  }

  .panel.user {
    justify-self: end;
    max-width: 88%;
  }

  .msg-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.1rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .msg-label .you {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .msg-label .who {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .msg-label .afford {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
  }

  .msg-body {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--fg);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .plan-head {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .plan-line,
  .plan-action,
  .tool-head,
  .tool-status {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    white-space: pre;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .plan-detail {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }

  .plan-line {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .plan-action,
  .tool-head {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .tool-status {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .facts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .facts li::before {
    content: "·";
    margin-right: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
